{title: Kadhalenum Thervezhuthi}
{artist: Balsubramaniam A R Rahman}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m] Kaadhal ennum [G#m] thervezhuthi,        [D#m] Kaaththirundha [A#] maanavan naan
Un [A#] ennam ennum yettil,        En [D#m] ennai paarththa podhu
Naanae [A#] ennai namba villai,        Endhan [D#m] kannai nambavillai
[D#m] Aaaaaaa,        [D#m] Indha valaikkaiyil
[D#m] Valaiyalgal naanallavaa,        Indru [A#] valaikkaiyai
[A#] Valaikkindra naalallavaa,        Sugam [D#m] valaikkaiyai
[D#m] Valaikkayil undaanadhu,        [G#m] Menmelum kaivalai valai Endru
[A#m] yengaadho,        Idhu [B] kannanga [D#m] laa Illai
[G#m] thennanga [D#m] llaa,        Indha [G#m] kanname [D#m] llaam Undhan
[G#m] chinnanga [D#m] laa,        Ingu [D#m] naan irundhen Verum
[A#] mei ezhuththaaga,        [D#m] Nee vandhu serndhaai
[A#] Uyir ezhuththaaga
